<title>UK: TENNIS-BRITAIN TAKE WINNING 3-0 LEAD OVER EGYPT IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BRITAIN TAKE WINNING 3-0 LEAD OVER EGYPT IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain took a winning 3-0 lead</p>
<p>over Egypt in their Davis Cup Euro/African zone group two, third</p>
<p>round tie after victory in the doubles on Saturday.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Neil Broad/Mark Petchey beat Tamer El Sawy/Amr Ghoneim 3-6 6-4</p>
<p>6-3 6-4</p>
</text>
